/* An asset's tile, as Assets' native grid shows one: its picture over its
   name, its kind badged in the picture's corner, and until the picture is
   ready its kind's icon as a skeleton, with a spinner while more of it
   loads. Alias it as data-alias-tile: an object with label, icon and badge
   (glyphs), image (a texture source such as kit:thumb:..., "" until one is
   ready), loading, selected and unresolved. Size the use; the tile fills
   it. Its look is the theme's .tile (theme/assets.rcss). */
body { display: block; }
.tile { width: 100%; height: 100%; }
